  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SOLELab: The future&apos;s Library in Boca de Camarones</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Imagine living without connectivity and Internet access. We believe that technology should serve all of us equally. That is why we are working on:  1. A SOLELab for an indigenous Wayuu community in Colombia: A public space where they can use the Internet to get access to education, digital literacy and create new opportunities, such as economic growth for their community.   2. An open source &quot;solutions guide&quot; for Internet connectivity, so that people can learn alternatives to be connected.</narrative>
  </description>
